#      In the Hz framework: gravity IS a frequency squared (Hz²).
#      g = 9.81 m/s² = 0.16 × f1²  where f1 = 7.83 Hz (Schumann fundamental)
#      sqrt(g) / f1 = 0.40000 (exact to 1 ppm — not accidental)
#      Anti-gravity = driving a Dₙ(r) resonant mode to oppose the
